<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK SEP DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 3.01 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK SEP DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 3.01 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on Thursday the required daily money market liquidity balance for the rest of the month was 3.01 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Sept 23		     7,100</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Sept	     6,406</p>
<p> Average reserves to Sept 18			  9,084</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    3,009</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom, +358-0-680 50 245</p>
